AIOStreams TV (packages/tizen-tv)

This package is part of AIOStreams (AGPL-3.0). Parts of its architecture and
code are adapted from samsucks, https://github.com/rfaile313/samsucks,
licensed GPL-3.0. GPLv3 section 13 permits combining the two works. Each adapted
file carries the header comment
  "Adapted from samsucks (https://github.com/rfaile313/samsucks), GPL-3.0".

Adapted from samsucks (raw files at the HEAD of its default branch):
  app/js/input.js            rAF-coalesced remote input, html.fast, text-input passthrough
  app/js/router.js           screen stack with hidden-but-mounted screens
  app/js/platform/tizen.js   key map, key registration, exit, screensaver
  app/js/util/dom.js         no-op-skipping DOM write helpers (h() signature changed)
  app/js/util/store.js       localStorage JSON wrapper (prefix changed)
  app/js/util/format.js      meta-line/duration helpers (reworked for Jellyfin DTOs)
  app/css/app.css            design tokens, nav, row, tile, ring, focus styles
Later phases will add (and list here when they do): ui/row.js, ui/grid.js,
ui/tile.js, ui/images.js, ui/backdrop.js, screens layouts.

Not adapted: branding. There is no "SamSUCKS" mascot or wordmark here.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1; license texts in app/fonts/):
  Inter              (c) The Inter Project Authors, https://github.com/rsms/inter
  Barlow Condensed   (c) The Barlow Project Authors, https://github.com/jpt/barlow
Files come from @fontsource/inter@5.0.18 and @fontsource/barlow-condensed@5.0.13.

app/icon.png is the AIOStreams Tizen icon copied from packages/smart-tv/tizen/icon.png.

Vendored (MIT): app/js/vendor/qrcode.js is qrcode-generator 1.4.4 by Kazuhiko Arase
(https://github.com/kazuhikoarase/qrcode-generator), license header kept in the file.
The QR code on the Connect screen encodes only the server's public web address.

Adapted from samsucks (screens/login.js, screens/search.js, screens/settings.js, ui/hud.js; GPL-3.0):
  app/js/screens/connect.js, app/js/screens/search.js, app/js/screens/settings.js,
  app/js/ui/keyboard.js, app/js/ui/hud.js (layout/focus-zone ideas and the fps overlay; reimplemented)

Phase 2 (agent A) additions adapted from samsucks (each file carries the attribution header):
  app/js/ui/images.js        concurrency-limited LIFO image loader with decode-before-attach and LRU
  app/js/ui/tile.js          recycled tile nodes, fill-on-change
  app/js/ui/row.js           virtualized row with stationary focus ring
  app/js/ui/grid.js          virtualized poster grid
  app/js/ui/backdrop.js      2x2 WebGL ambience, cross-fading hero art
  app/js/screens/{home,library}.js, app/css/browse.css   layout and focus handling of the browse screens

Adapted from samsucks, phase 2 (playback and detail; agent B):
  app/js/platform/player.js    AVPlay / <video> backend (seek serialisation and DTS notes from packages/web tizen/player.ts)
  app/js/player/subtitles.js   CueTrack lookup (parser rewritten)
  app/js/player/seek.js        seek-preview commit delay and step escalation
  app/js/player/pick.js        direct-play whitelist
  app/js/player/osd.js         OSD layout and timing
  app/js/player/tracks.js      audio / subtitle picker panel
  app/js/screens/player.js     playback screen: OSD, seek preview, track picker, up-next countdown
  app/js/screens/detail.js     detail layout and button / season / episode zones
  app/js/screens/sources.js    list-with-stationary-focus panel
  app/css/detail.css           detail, sources and player styles

